    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/0409ba58f42de119222f8f88134f96ac.poster.avif?t=1753382918\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/0409ba58f42de119222f8f88134f96ac.gif?t=1753382918\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A point-and-click visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 300,000 characters of narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A smoking girl dragging around a TV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden quantum mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No &quot;just parry&quot; mechanic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/ad5039a48cb0b0ed4d06e62c61bcc584.poster.avif?t=1753382918\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/ad5039a48cb0b0ed4d06e62c61bcc584.gif?t=1753382918\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a freelance writer named Lovecatch. Due to childhood trauma, they are unable to speak and have no combat experience. However, after saving a wounded, mysterious creature known as a Mamono, they are unexpectedly chosen to become a &quot;Hero.&quot; Lovecatch\u2019s mission is to &quot;persuade&quot; an entity called the &quot;Demon King,&quot; who is said to command the Mamono, and bring an end to the 900-year-long war against these creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/18a17f7b0e299972903f9dfa2b1b64c8.poster.avif?t=1753382918\" width=479 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/18a17f7b0e299972903f9dfa2b1b64c8.webm?t=1753382918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/0409ba58f42de119222f8f88134f96ac.poster.avif?t=1753382918\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/0409ba58f42de119222f8f88134f96ac.gif?t=1753382918\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A point-and-click visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 300,000 characters of narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A smoking girl dragging around a TV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden quantum mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No &quot;just parry&quot; mechanic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/ad5039a48cb0b0ed4d06e62c61bcc584.poster.avif?t=1753382918\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/ad5039a48cb0b0ed4d06e62c61bcc584.gif?t=1753382918\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a freelance writer named Lovecatch. Due to childhood trauma, they are unable to speak and have no combat experience. However, after saving a wounded, mysterious creature known as a Mamono, they are unexpectedly chosen to become a &quot;Hero.&quot; Lovecatch\u2019s mission is to &quot;persuade&quot; an entity called the &quot;Demon King,&quot; who is said to command the Mamono, and bring an end to the 900-year-long war against these creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/18a17f7b0e299972903f9dfa2b1b64c8.poster.avif?t=1753382918\" width=479 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380620/extras/18a17f7b0e299972903f9dfa2b1b64c8.webm?t=1753382918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A point-and-click visual novel updating the classic &quot;hero vs. demon king&quot; fantasy into a cynical modern world where you can\u2019t win by force alone. What defines a hero now? Will they be paid, or get any compensation at all?",
